<title>USA: Pepperell, Mass., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</title>
<headline>Pepperell, Mass., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross Inc. said it won $1.900 million of Pepperell, Mass., municipal purpose limited tax loan of 1997 bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.8377 percent.</p>
</text>
